    {
      "id": "reducer-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 75,
      "y": 643,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 224,
      "text": "REDUCER: addServiceGroupOperation\nFile: service-group.ts:17-84\n──────────────────────────────────\n1. Guard: PENDING or ACTIVE (D-6)\n   else → StructuralChangeNotAllowedAddGroupError\n\n2. Push new group to state.serviceGroups[]\n   with recurringCost, setupCost, services: []\n\n3. If ACTIVE + recurringAmount:\n   proratedCost = calculateProratedCost(\n     recurringAmount, cycleStart, nextBillingDate, now\n   )\n   totalDebt += proratedCost\n\n4. If ACTIVE + setupAmount:\n   totalDebt += setupAmount (full, not prorated)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 72,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "reducer-box",
      "groupIds": ["impl"]
    },

    {
      "id": "utils-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 635,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 73,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "roundness": { "type": 3 },
      "boundElements": [{"id": "utils-text", "type": "text"}],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "groupIds": ["impl"]
    },
    {
      "id": "utils-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 545,
      "y": 643,
      "width": 370,
      "height": 224,
      "text": "UTILS: calculateProratedCost\nFile: utils.ts:58-68\n──────────────────────────────────\nfunction calculateProratedCost(\n  amount, cycleStart, cycleEnd, effectiveDate\n):\n  totalDays = daysBetween(cycleStart, cycleEnd)\n  remainingDays = daysBetween(effectiveDate, cycleEnd)\n  if totalDays <= 0 or remainingDays <= 0: return 0\n  return (remainingDays / totalDays) * amount\n\nWouter's example:\n  amount=100, 30-day cycle, 10 days in\n  remaining=20, total=30\n  (20/30) × 100 = €66.67 → pays 2/3 ✓",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#e8590c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 74,
      "version": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": "utils-box",
      "groupIds": ["impl"]
    },

