    {
      "id": "editor-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 975,
      "y": 643,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 224,
      "text": "EDITOR UI\n──────────────────────────────────\nServicesPanel.tsx\n  \"+ Add Service Group\" button\n  Operator mode, PENDING or ACTIVE\n  Modal: group name + recurring amount\n  Reads add-ons from service offering\n  via useServiceOfferingAddons hook\n\nBillingPanel.tsx\n  Outstanding Balance = debt - credit\n  Updates immediately on dispatch\n  Red when positive\n\nSCHEMA: AddServiceGroupInput\n  groupId, name, optional, costType\n  recurringAmount ← prorated field\n  setupAmount, currencies, discount",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#2b8a3e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 76,
