      "height": 64,
      "text": "WHY SERVICES DON'T HAVE PRORATION\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\naddService / addServiceToGroup have no proration.\nServices are deliverables. Groups are the billable unit.\nGroup's recurringCost covers all its services.",
