      "text": "GAP: QUANTITY CHANGE WITHIN GROUP (upfront-variable)\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────\nGoogle Workspace applies same formula to seat count changes (3→1).\nOur model only supports whole group add/remove.\nWould need: quantity field on ServiceGroup + UPDATE_SERVICE_GROUP_QUANTITY op.\nFormula already exists — missing the structural hook.",
